<title>USA: NationsBank incorporates new capital unit.</title>
<headline>NationsBank incorporates new capital unit.</headline>
<dateline>ST. LOUIS 1997-04-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>NationsBank Corp said Friday it incorporated Boatmen's Capital Management Inc, a newly formed subsidiary that, following regulatory approvals, will specialize in managing fixed-income investments in institutional accounts.</p>
<p>It said Landers Carnal will become president of the new subsidiary. He has served as chief fixed-income investment officer for Boatmen's Trust Co since 1992 and as an executive vice president since 1995.</p>
<p>NationsBank acquired Boatmen's Bancshares earlier this year.</p>
<p>((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
